    "fabric": "210 GSM heavyweight cotton (subject to manufacturer confirmation). Designed for a substantial feel, comfortable everyday wear, and a structured oversized appearance.",
    "fit": "Oversized / relaxed fit, dropped shoulders, classic ribbed crew neck, half sleeves, and a straight-cut hem.",
    "care": "Machine wash cold, inside out.\n\nWash with similar dark colours.\n\nUse mild detergent.\n\nDo not bleach.\n\nDo not iron directly over the graphic print.\n\nDry in shade to help preserve colour and print quality.",
    "story": "ONE NAME. ONE NUMBER. COUNTLESS MEMORIES.\n\nFrom record-breaking innings to unforgettable championship celebrations, Rohit Sharma has given cricket fans moments worth remembering forever.\n\nThe Hitman 45 Tribute Oversized T-Shirt celebrates his extraordinary journey through a detailed, multi-layered collage featuring memorable innings, iconic celebrations, the Indian jersey, and the legendary No. 45.\n\nThe artwork brings together striking blue and orange tones, black-and-white cricket photography, and standout details including 264 — The Greatest ODI Innings of All Time and I Will Always Bleed Blue.\n\nSet against a deep navy blue base, the graphic creates a bold yet balanced streetwear aesthetic.\n\nDesigned for cricket lovers who carry their passion beyond the stadium, this piece is more than an everyday T-shirt. It's a tribute to the memories, milestones, and emotions that define a generation of Indian cricket.",
    "highlights": "Rohit Sharma tribute collage artwork\n\nIconic No. 45 jersey details\n\nRecord-breaking 264-run innings tribute\n\nIndian cricket championship celebrations\n\nBlue, orange and monochrome graphic composition\n\nDeep navy blue colour\n\nCentered graphic placement\n\nOversized drop-shoulder silhouette\n\nUnisex streetwear styling",
    "id": "c40837c8-ed46-4301-ab30-ffa162a43a95",
