    "story": "Make a statement without saying a word. The Venomous Oversized Graphic T-Shirt brings together fearless design and contemporary streetwear style.\n\nFeaturing bold red VENOMOUS typography accented by a detailed black snake illustration, this T-shirt creates a powerful visual contrast against its crisp white base.\n\nIts relaxed, oversized silhouette, dropped shoulders, and classic crew neckline deliver an effortlessly cool look, making it ideal for casual outings and everyday fashion.\n\nPair it with baggy jeans, cargos, or relaxed-fit trousers to complete your streetwear look.",
